  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">African Union: &quot;Re-activation of AU Panel on Trade Negotiations&quot; St&#xf6;d till den &#xe5;teruppr&#xe4;ttade &quot;AU Expert Panel on Trade Negotiations&quot;. Panelen skall st&#xe4;rka AU:s medlemsl&#xe4;nders kapacitet att f&#xf6;rhandla handelsavtal mellan AVS-l&#xe4;dnerna och EU. Panelen skall ocks&#xe5; genomf&#xf6;ra forskning inomn det handelspolitiska omr&#xe5;det med fokus p&#xe5; de afrikanska l&#xe4;ndernas situation. Svenskt st&#xf6;d: MSEK 1.5.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">African Union: &quot;Re-activation of AU Panel on Trade Negotiations&quot; Support to the re-activation of AU Expert Panel on Trade Nego-tiations. The Panel shall strengthen AU member states&apos; capacity to negotiate trade agreements between the AVS countries and the EU. The Panel shall also carry through research in the area of trade policy with focus on African countries&apos; situation. Sw support MSEK</narrative>
  </description>
